#X obj 250 1033 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1033 @connect;
#X text 270 1033 When set to 1: tries to connect to the Raspberry Pi
GPIO and acquire exclusive ownership of the pin. When set to 0: disconnects
from the GPIO and releases ownership of the pin. Type: bool. Default
value: 0\.;
#X obj 250 1105 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1105 @freq;
#X text 270 1105 PWM frequency. Type: float. Units: 'Hz'. Default value:
50.0\. Range: [30.0\..100.0].;
#X obj 250 1147 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1147 @max_accel;
#X text 270 1147 Maximum acceleration (rate of change of velocity).
A reasonable starting value for initial tuning is 5–10 times the value
of @max_vel. The final value should be determined empirically \, taking
into account the moving mass and the drive's dynamic response. Unit:
°/s². Type: float. Default value: 6000.0\. Min value: 10.0\.;
#X obj 250 1250 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1250 @max_jerk;
#X text 270 1250 Maximum jerk (rate of change of acceleration). Determines
the smoothness of motion start and stop. Higher values result in sharper
motion \, lower values produce smoother motion. The value should be
tuned empirically for the specific mechanical system and dynamic requirements.
Unit: °/s³. Type: float. Default value: 60000.0\. Min value: 10.0\.;
#X obj 250 1368 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1368 @max_pulse;
#X text 270 1368 Maximum PWM pulse width corresponding to a 180-degree
rotation. Type: float. Units: 'ms'. Default value: 2.125\. Range: [1.5\..3.0].;
#X obj 250 1425 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1425 @max_vel;
#X text 270 1425 Maximum angular velocity of the servo in °/s. For
the SG90 model it reaches about 600°/s (this value may vary with the
operating voltage). Type: float. Default value: 600.0\. Min value:
10.0\.;
#X obj 250 1497 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1497 @min_pulse;
#X text 270 1497 Minimum PWM pulse width corresponding to a 0-degree
rotation. Type: float. Units: 'ms'. Default value: 0.5125\. Range:
