#X text 130 2197 1\.;
#X msg 170 2197 done;
#X text 270 2197 This event fires when the servo movement command is
finished. Note: "finished" means the command has been sent and processed
\, not that the servo has physically stopped moving. The servo may
still be rotating (this is particularly noticeable when @smooth = 0).;
#X msg 170 2282 angle;
#X text 270 2282 outputs the current rotation angle in degrees.;
#X msg 170 2307 time;
#X text 270 2307 outputs the current time position in milliseconds
within the calculated smoothed motion trajectory (only when @smooth
= 1).;
